			x: 2.5d
			y: -0.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["6F7D1EDC2EF88924"]
			description: [
				"&o&7埃莱奥诺尔游记，第七卷笔记"
				""
				"&fThe blood pumpkin will slowly fill up with delicious mystical blood over time. This will draw monsters who will try to consume the blood for themselves. Therefore, sanguines will have to protect valiently their blood pumpkins during the festival. Turns out, there's also all sorts of creatures that don't exactly want to eat this pumpkin, but want to destroy it to prevent accumulation of stronger predators."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&f装满后，可以打破血南瓜来获得一些好东西，甚至还能得到钻石等晶体宝石。将血泡泡压入血瓶中，还能获得净血收益。这种南瓜的表皮也变得非常坚硬。"
			]
